    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_arth_letsgetapathcleared_1": "Let’s get a path cleared.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_arth_movethedebris_1": "Move the debris.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_arth_nicetoseeyougentswhe_1": "Nice to see you gents. Where do we stand?",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_arth_sunupsanhourawayatbe_1": "Sun up's an hour away at best. There's no time for a sit-down.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_arth_thosegermancasemates_1": "Those German casemates aren't that far away. I think we can get to them in time, so I say we take them out.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_arth_thunder": "Thunder! Thunder! Don't shoot!",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_arth_youknowwhatsatstakey_1": "You know what's at stake. You all do.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_rich_alrightkingsleylooks_1": "Alright Kingsley. Looks like you're in charge now. Casemates and Valhalla are that way.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_rich_damnyoukingsleywepeg_1": "Damn you Kingsley. We pegged you as a Kraut. Lucky we didn't fill you full of lead.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_rich_needtoclearoutnow_1": "Need to clear out, now.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_rich_orderskingsley_1": "Kingsley, orders?",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_rich_soyoufancyyourselfth_1": "So you fancy yourself the captain now.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_rich_thecaptaindidntmakei_1": "The Captain didn't make it, so we're on our own now. I say we dig in, and wait for the rest of the 6th airborne to assemble.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_rich_thecompaniesscattere_1": "The company's scattered. We're pissing in the wind at this point.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_rich_thisismadness_1": "This is madness.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_rich_waitingonyoukingsley_1": "Waiting on you, Kingsley.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_rich_wayisclearletsgo_1": "Way is clear. Let's go.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_rich_wayisclearwerereadyk_1": "Way's clear. We're ready, Kingsley.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_rich_weshouldgetmovingwha_1": "We should get moving. What's the plan, Kingsley?",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_rich_yeahtheresalsonomusc_1": "Yeah, there's also no muscle and no cavalry coming to save the bloody day! The only thing we can do here is to die or try not to.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_rich_youheardthesargeclea_1": "You heard the Sarge, clear that debris!",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_thom_heywerebeyondmadness_1": "Hey! We're beyond madness... Look, I'm with Arthur. We finish the mission.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/sp_tnga_wind_thom_heyyoutwoscrappinove_1": "Hey! You two scrappin' over who's got the bigger bollocks ain't gonna solve nothin'.",
    "subtitle_sp_tnga_wind/thomas_jones": "Thomas Jones"
}